    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "20×20×20 ama",
      "rationale": "Debire ke khowupo — botee, bophara le bophagamo bo a lekanngwa ka ama tše masomepedi ka tsela e tee."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "gauta e tswaletšwego",
      "rationale": "סגור ke 'go tswalela' — barutwi ba bangwe ba re 'gauta e hlwekilego' (ya koalwago ya sepele), ba bangwe 'gauta ya go koala' sebopego ka botlalo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "aletare ya ereze",
      "rationale": "ויצף מזבח ארז — 'a khupetša aletare ka ereze' (aletare o agilwe ka ereze) kgahlanong le 'aletare ya ereze o o khupeditšwego ka gauta'; go sa dumelelwe ga barutwi."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Mophelo ga Debire: masomepedi ama botee, masomepedi ama bophara, gomme masomepedi ama bophagamo bja bophara bja yona; gomme a e khupetša ka gauta e tswaletšwego, gomme a khupetša aletare ya ereze.",
